.Dd November 26, 2026
.Dt RETICULUM-GO-CP 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm reticulum-go-cp , rgocp
.Nd copy files over Reticulum links
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm reticulum-go Cm cp
.Op Fl l
.Op Fl f
.Op Fl config Ar path
.Op Ar ...
.Sh DESCRIPTION
Transfers files over established Reticulum links.
Listen mode
.Pq Fl l
receives files.
Fetch mode
.Pq Fl f
requests a remote path.
Without those flags, files are sent to a destination.
.Sh FLAG PARSING
Flags may appear before, between, or after positional arguments. A literal
.Cm --
ends flag parsing.
.Sh OPTIONS
.Bl -tag -width "--no-compress"
.It Fl config Ar path
Config file or directory. A directory uses the file named config inside it.
.It Fl p
Print the full identity hash and full destination hash, then exit. With
.Fl json ,
print one JSON object with plain hex values and no angle brackets.
.It Fl b Ar seconds , Fl announce Ar seconds
Listen announce interval. Zero announces once at startup. Negative values disable
announces. Positive values repeat at that interval.
.It Fl a Ar hash
Allowed remote identity hash. Repeatable. Bare 32-character hex and angle-bracketed
hex are accepted. Truncated hashes are rejected.
.It Fl n , Fl no-auth
Accept requests from anyone in listen mode.
.El
.Sh ALLOWED IDENTITIES
Listen mode reads
.Pa /etc/rncp/allowed_identities ,
.Pa ~/.config/rncp/allowed_identities ,
.Pa ~/.rncp/allowed_identities ,
.Pa ~/.config/rgocp/allowed_identities ,
and
.Pa ~/.rgocp/allowed_identities .
Each line contains one full 32-character hexadecimal identity hash. Angle brackets
are accepted. Blank lines and lines whose first non-space character is
.Cm #
are ignored. Invalid lines are skipped.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr reticulum-go 1
.Sh AUTHORS
.An Quad4.io
